                    <!-- Project Meta -->
                    <div class="project-meta meta-summary">

                        <!-- Meta Content-->
                        <h5>The Fraser Rise Men's Shed is a community space promoting mental health and combating social
                            isolation among men. It offers a relaxed environment for regular meetups, featuring
                            activities like cooking, crafts, and music. The Shed hosts daytime and evening gatherings
                            with meals, encouraging open discussions about emotions. Monthly visits from a psychologist
                            provide mental health strategies and support reconnecting with family and friends, all aimed
                            at boosting members' wellbeing and self-esteem.</h5>
                        <!-- /Meta Content-->

                    </div>
